system: shader-runner
unit: shared-data-imports
kind: workflow
source:
  repo: bevy_shader_runner
  paths:
    - src/watch/writer.rs

## modules
Writer — groups reload results into batches @ src/watch/writer.rs

## data
use terrain-erosion/mesh-terrain-chunks: ChunkMesh, ChunkCoord
use get-map-tile: TileFormat
struct MeshBatch {
  kind: TileFormat,
  items: Vec<ChunkMesh>,
}

in:  Queue<ChunkCoord>
out: Stream<MeshBatch>

## behavior
- pull a ChunkCoord from the queue
- collect ChunkMeshes into a MeshBatch keyed by TileFormat

## invariants
- every ChunkMesh belongs to exactly one MeshBatch
